  "description": "Keeps all the easy comfort of the Core and turns it into a “go‑far” machine for riders who want more. You still get that ultra‑low, confidence‑inspiring step‑through and upright position, but with extra power and range so you can say yes to steeper hills, longer routes, and all‑day adventures. It’s built for people who plan to ride a lot and don’t want to worry about running out of juice or struggling to keep up with friends. Just like every Pedego, it uses UL 2271‑certified battery packs and a system that meets UL 2849 safety standards, so the motor, battery, and charger are all tested to work together safely and reliably. Pedego chooses these tried‑and‑true components so you can push your rides farther with confidence, knowing safety isn’t an afterthought.",
